Subject: [PATCH 09/11] radv: keep fp8 conversions vectorized

---
 src/amd/compiler/aco_interface.cpp | 2 ++
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline.c     | 4 ++++
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_shader.c       | 4 ++++
 3 files changed, 10 insertions(+)

